        }
      ],
      "orig": "In this Specialization, learners acquired essential knowledge and skills for data analysis with SQL using open source distributed big data systems. Through a sequence of three courses, learners gained knowledge of the fundamental concepts behind relational databases, SQL, and big data; learned how to write and run SQL queries using query engines including Apache Hive and Apache Impala; and learned how to manage large-scale data in clusters and cloud storage using the Hadoop Distributed File System (HDFS) and Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3).",
      "text": "In this Specialization, learners acquired essential knowledge and skills for data analysis with SQL using open source distributed big data systems. Through a sequence of three courses, learners gained knowledge of the fundamental concepts behind relational databases, SQL, and big data; learned how to write and run SQL queries using query engines including Apache Hive and Apache Impala; and learned how to manage large-scale data in clusters and cloud storage using the Hadoop Distributed File System (HDFS) and Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)."
    },
